# Review routing for schema changes.
# Placed in the schema directory so changes to this file move with the schemas.
# GitHub also reads CODEOWNERS from .github/ and the repo root — until a repo-
# wide version exists, this acts as documentation of who owns what.
#
# Format: <path> <owners...>

# Producer-owned schemas
PendingTxEvent.json                @mempool-monitor-owners
OperatorVerdict.json               @detection-engine-owners
ThreatConfirmedEvent.json          @detection-engine-owners
ThreatConfirmedEvent_v2.json       @federation-coordinator-owners @detection-engine-owners
CounterfactualReadyEvent.json      @counterfactual-sim-owners
DefenseSubmittedEvent.json         @defense-agent-owners
DefenseMinedEvent.json             @defense-agent-owners
LedgerRecordedEvent.json           @zk-prover-owners
PreemptiveStrikeEvent.json         @preemptive-strike-owners
TrainingEvent.json                 @learning-loop-owners

# Policy + fixtures + versioning doc are platform-wide
README.md                          @platform-owners
CHANGELOG.md                       @platform-owners
fixtures/*                         @platform-owners
